{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10498","headline":"同崔员外綦毋拾遗九日宴京兆府李士曹 · 高适","name":"同崔员外綦毋拾遗九日宴京兆府李士曹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今日好相见，羣贤仍废曹。\n晚晴催翰墨，秋兴引风骚。\n绦叶拥虚砌，黄花随浊醪。\n闭门无不可，何事更登高。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10498.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10498","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}